  "seoDescription": "Implement row-major matrix multiplication in CUDA with one thread per output element and inner-product accumulation.",
  "description": "Perform general 2D matrix multiplication A * B.\n\n**Mathematical Formulation:**\n\n$$\nC_{ij} = \\sum_{k} A_{ik} B_{kj}\n$$\n\n**Step-by-Step Implementation:**\n1. Validate inner dimension alignment.\n2. Compute matrix product.\n3. Return resulting matrix.\n\n**Returns:** 2D list of multiplied elements.",
